
This file is an example. Rename it to .env before running docker-compose

These credentials are for demo purposes only.

Go App

APP_PORT=8080
POSTGRES_DSN=postgres://app_user:app_pass@postgres:5432/app_db?sslmode=disable
REDIS_ADDR=redis:6379

PostgreSQL

POSTGRES_USER=app_user
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=app_pass
POSTGRES_DB=app_db

Grafana

GRAFANA_ADMIN_USER=admin
GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin
